  m_Name: Tourist
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TipGiver
  displayName: Tourist
  lieChance: 0.4
  truthLines:
  - "oh my gosh wait—are you going to {dest}? we just walked that. you wanna {dir}. you'll go right by {a}, and then {b} shows up. that's when you know you're close. sorry, my english..."
  - "excuse me! {dest}? yes we know it. you wanna {dir}. we took a photo in front of {a}. after that you will see {b}. the guidebook even had a little arrow. i can show you the page."
  - "sorry to stop you. we were trying to find {dest} all afternoon. you wanna {dir}. you'll pass {a}, then {b} is on the corner. we got lost twice so now i am an expert. kind of."
  - "oh! {dest}! you wanna {dir}. {a} is on my camera roll, see? then {b} is right after, you cannot miss it. my partner is waving, i should go. good luck!"
  - "sorry, english. if you want {dest}, you wanna {dir}. we walked from {a}. you'll pass {b} after that. the hostel guy drew it on a napkin. the napkin is wet now. but i remember."
  - "wait wait wait. {dest}. you wanna {dir}. look for {a}, that's the one we used. then {b} pops up and you are basically there. we walked it in flip flops. you will be fine."
  lieLines:
  - "my phone says {dest} is that way. you wanna {dir}. it pins {a}. the little blue dot is very confident. i trust the little blue dot. you should too."
  - "map says you wanna {dir} if you want {dest}. it also says look for {a}. we followed it into a parking garage once. but this time it feels right. trust the map!"
  - "hotel guy said if you want {dest}, you wanna {dir}. he pointed at {a} like it was famous. i nodded. i did not understand the pointing. still. that's the tip."
  - "i think you wanna {dir} if you want {dest}. {a} looked like the spot on the postcard. we did not actually get there. but the postcard was very pretty. so."
  - "gps says you wanna {dir} if you're going to {dest}. {a} has to be close, it is on the screenshot. my battery is at four percent. i am committing to this."
  - "hostel said you wanna {dir} and look for {a} if you want {dest}. they said it very fast. i wrote it down wrong once already. this is the corrected version. i hope."
